# AgriMarket Mobile - Expo Go + LAN (KHONG USB reverse)
#
# Cach chay khuyen nghi tu root repo:
#   pnpm dev:mobile
#
# Hoac chay toan bo:
#   pnpm dev
#
# Launcher se:
#   1. dam bao API dang healthy tai :3000;
#   2. tu tim LAN IPv4 cua may tinh;
#   3. inject EXPO_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=http://<LAN_IP>:3000;
#   4. chay Expo Go bang --lan tren Metro :8081.
#
# Dien thoai va may tinh can cung mang LAN/Wi-Fi.
# KHONG dung 127.0.0.1 cho dien thoai that.
#
# Neu may co nhieu card mang, co the override:
# AGRIMARKET_LAN_IP=192.168.1.10
#
# Hoac override truc tiep API:
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=http://192.168.1.10:3000
#
# EXPO_PUBLIC_* la bien public phia client. KHONG dat secret o day.
